# Minimal self-authored ASCII OBJ triangle fixture for RustSMF static load parity tests.
# Matches the spirit of test.fbx (simple, no skin, no anim, for preview-only parity).
# Includes normals and UVs to avoid computeTangents errors in Three.js.
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0 0 1
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 0 1
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1